@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
left to right direction

component "hand-side workload" as HandWorkload
component "actrail-sb" as Sb
component "actrail-vsock-gateway" as Gateway
component "actraild\nGateway ingest + Sandbox plugins" as Daemon
database "Sandbox Evidence DB" as EvidenceDb
database "Sandbox Alert DB" as AlertDb

HandWorkload --> Sb : Guest-local observation
Sb --> Gateway : VSOCK Hand frame
Gateway --> Daemon : TCP Hand frame
Daemon --> EvidenceDb : 无匹配使用方
Daemon --> AlertDb : Sandbox 插件提交 alert
@enduml
